<h3 id="index-creation" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Index creation</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#index-creation" aria-label="Link to Index creation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>The pg_search index is larger than the GIN index on message, but it <strong>builds faster</strong>:</p>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Index type</th><th>Build time (min)</th><th>Index size (MB)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Postgres GIN</td><td>2.60</td><td>176</td></tr><tr><td>pg_search BM25</td><td>1.63</td><td>647</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>The BM25 index is indexing six columns at once, whereas the GIN index is limited to indexing only the text column. pg_search can efficiently handle queries that combine full-text search with filters on multiple fields (such as numeric, timestamp, and JSON attributes) without requiring additional indexes.</p>
<h3 id="query-performance" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Query performance</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#query-performance" aria-label="Link to Query performance"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
